# CHANGELOG

## [0.3.0] - 2026-10-30

### Added

- --uvm Enable  UVM for compile-and-run or compile-only
- --test-name   NAME Set +UVM_TESTNAME=NAME
- --compile     Compile only; do not simulate
- --run, -R     Run the prior compile in this top's output directory

## [0.2.2] - 2026-10-28

### Added

- add opts using --mem mem_files for simulation

## [0.2.1] - 2026-10-28

### Added

- using xrun_args += for clearer definition

## [0.2.0] - 2026-10-28

### Added

- Porting xcelium runner script for behavioral simulation

## [0.1.3] - 2026-10-22

### Added

- A `--build-test` Docker runner option to initialize and build `riscv-tests`
  for RV32, then install generated tests under the RISC-V toolchain prefix.
- Pytest and Autoconf in the Docker image.
- README instructions for building RISC-V tests.

### Removed

- The generated `docker/tests/test.elf` binary; tests should build it when
  needed.

## [0.1.2] - 2026-10-18

### Added

- Initial repository setup for the RISC-V tools project.
- Docker image and helper scripts for building and running the development
  environment.
- YAML-driven test runner and sample test program.

